                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Olkilikuai ele oipirta Turo. Enteyietu enchira, na melin e Tarshishi, amu eitomijoonoki Turo neaku metii enkaji aashu ewueji neitasheyieki! Ore ebaiki enkop e Kupro eibalakinyeki ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entirring'ata intae kulo oomanya olomanaa le naiposha, lo ainyiang'ak le Sidon, etalang'a apa lelo lirriwaitie intae enkare nepuo ninche aaim nkariak kumok; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore ropiyiani inyi naa ina tapa e Shihor, ina kisampuare o lkeju le Nail; iyie apa olbiasharai loo loreren. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tukurru iyie Sidon, amu eiroro enaiposha, ine nerripieki enaiposha ejo, “Eitu nanu atum emion e saisai neitu aisho, neitu nanu aitubulu layiok aashu ntoyie.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Te nelotu ilo omoni Misiri, nejing ninche osina tenkaraki ilo omoni oipirta Turo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entulusoi enchom Tarshishi, enteyietu enchira, intae lelo oomanya olomanaa le naiposha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kena ninye enkanasa ino e ng'ida, naa ore enkiterunoto enye naa apa moitie, ore nkejek enyena netanapa ninye meshomo amanyisho te nkop nalakua? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaing'ae oipirua ena, agilunore Turo, naa ninye naishooyo maupen e nkitoo. Ore apa lelo ainyiang'ak lenyena naa eikituaak, ore lelo amirak lenyena naa ilooyanyiti te nkop? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eipirua Olaitoriani loo lororani ina, pee einyal ilo wuasa ena kitoo pooki, nesul ilo pooki oyanyiti te nkop. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mputa ntadooi te nkop ino anaa olkeju le Nail, na tito e Tarshishi; meekure eetae entoki nikimbooyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eitorioyie ninye enkaina enye aitalang enaiposha, eigirigirie ninye nkitoriat; eishorua Olaitoriani enkitanapata naipirta Kanaan, pee eidaikie lelo sempewueti lenyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo ninye: “Mingil ae kata iyie ang'ida na tito ena natusulaki e Sidon; tudumunye shomo Kupro, ore ake sii te ine milo atum enkiyeng'iyeng.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ura ina kop oo Lkaldayo! Ilo orere apa, mme ile Asiria, oopuo aaishooyo Turo metaa enoo lowuarak le ntim. Neirrag ninche aang'adu ninye, nerasaki nena ajijik enyena e nkitoo, neing'uaa ina anasa etaa enkidaata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Teyietu nchira iyie Tarshishi, amu ore osempewuet lino neitomijoonoki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore kenya te ina olong, nemeitokini aadamu Turo too larin ntomoni naapishana, naaba anaa nkolong'i o laiguanani obo. Ore te siadi lelo arin ntomoni naapishana netiu te Turo anaa enatiu te ilosinkolio le mulayoi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tudumu enkawuo oo sinkoliotin, tamanimanai te nkanasa, na mulayoi ena nemedamuni! Taranyisho to ltoilo sidai, taranya isinkolioitin kumok, pee kitumi aatadamu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te siadi ilarin ntomoni naapishana naa emutan Olaitoriani Turo. Naa kerrinyokino ninye olekoisiaayio lenye, nelo aiborrie onyek te nena kitoriat e nkop naatii oriong e nkop. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ina biashara enye o lekoisiaayio lenye neiteng'elakini Olaitoriani; meshumi ninye nemeirragieki aaisudoo, kake ore ina biashara enye kelo ainyiang'u endaa sapuk o nkilani sidain ainyang'aki lelo ootoni te dukuya Olaitoriani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
